738 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Deflections is a series of ink works developed through a limited set of relational and directional conditions\056 Devoid of a predetermined image\054 the lines are repeated\054 connected\054 and subsequently deflected from the initial structure\056 The repeated movements allow the lines to accumulate as deposits\054 leaving incomplete forms that were not anticipated at the outset\056 The series investigates how organization provides the conditions necessary for form while never controlling what emerges within it\056 )
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 739 0 R
     /Pg 696 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
